Conceptual reference (not redistributed as source or binaries)
--------------------------------------------------------------
Motorola-style Chop-Chop / Quick Capture behavior and LineageOS
`MotoActions` virtual sensor IDs (e.g. 65546 / camera-activate) were
studied as public documentation and reverse-engineering references.
This repository ships an independent software classifier for the
LSM6DSV IMU on POCO F7. It does not include Motorola proprietary
SensorHub firmware, binaries, or OEM APKs.

